> Is there a way to prevent wincmd window switching from switch into the tree window? I find myself switching between code windows and unintentionally ending up in the minimap window, which I don't want.

@kovasap, on latest `main` by default map window is now not focusable with normal methods (`wincmd`, `<C-w>`, or mouse).

If someone wants focusability with mouse (but also with `wincmd` and `<C-w>`, as Neovim window setting can only toggle them together), set `config.window.focusable` to `true`.
